WEBVTT

00:01:28.356 --> 00:01:31.596
and I needed that to work around
my basketball schedule.

00:01:32.196 --> 00:01:36.796
I ran to the library
to figure out what an herbarium was.

00:01:36.796 --> 00:01:39.036
(Laughter)

00:01:39.036 --> 00:01:40.356
And it turns out

00:01:40.356 --> 00:01:44.436
an herbarium is where they store
dead, dried plants.

00:01:45.356 --> 00:01:47.076
I was lucky to land the job.

00:01:47.116 --> 00:01:50.316
So my first scientific job

00:01:50.356 --> 00:01:55.676
was gluing dead plants onto paper
for hours on end.

00:01:55.716 --> 00:01:58.996
(Laughter)

00:01:58.996 --> 00:02:00.156
It's so glamorous.